[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-fbm-scholarship-2026-florence-bamidele-makanjuola-scholarship-for-nigerian-undergraduates-176":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},176,"fbm-scholarship-2026-florence-bamidele-makanjuola-scholarship-for-nigerian-undergraduates-176","Fbm Scholarship 2026 (florence Bamidele Makanjuola Scholarship) For Nigerian Undergraduates","\u003Cp>The Opekete Foundation is delighted to announce the commencement of applications for the 2026 Florence MakanjuOla Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Florence MakanjuOla FBM Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Florence MakanjuOla Fund\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦650,000\u002FYr (Undergraduates)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦350,000\u002FYr (High School)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>International scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: May 22, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Florence MakanjuOla FBM Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Opekete Foundation is thrilled to announce our 2026 FBM Scholarships for future nurses and \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffbm-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>educators\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The foundation is committed to supporting and empowering the next generation of teachers and healthcare professionals with financial assistance to help them succeed and innovate in their fields.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Opekete Foundation is in memory of Late Mrs Florence Bamidele Makanjuola who built a career in teaching and nursing. Aside her passion for the promoting female self dependence , Mrs Makanjuola in her lifetime expressed dissatisfaction at the current state of \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffbm-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> and calibre of teachers available.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To keep her dream alive, her children and grandchildren have decided to keep continue with the scholarships via the Florence Fund\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Florence MakanjuOla FBM Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Secondary School Students\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Maximum of ₦350,000 per annum for each student.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University Students\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Available Programmes for Florence Bamidele MakanjuOla Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is open to Nigerian students who are currently or interested in studying Teaching \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffbm-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Science\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> Technology Engineering &amp; Mathematics (STEM) or Nursing in the University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Study Grants &amp; Scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Florence MakanjuOla Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate Florence MakanjuOla Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A female Nigerian Citizen\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have gained admission\u002F or currently enrolled into a public university or Senior Secondary School while applying for this opportunity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must be attending or intending to attend a public or federal government owned Senior Secondary School or University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Intending and\u002For willing to study Teaching Science Technology Engineering &amp; Mathematics (STEM) or Nursing in the University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Academic Qualifications\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Secondary School Applicants\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of 5 Distinctions (A or B) in English, Mathematics and any other 3 major subjects in Junior WAEC (Secondary applicants)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>International scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University Applicants\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of 5 Distinctions (A1- B3) in English, Mathematics and any other 3 major subjects in WAEC \u002F NECO at one sitting\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Meet the required cut-off score in JAMB for the course and school applied to.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Florence MakanjuOla FBM Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Florence MakanjuOla FBM Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If you meet the required qualifications,,\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fforms.gle\u002Fgnt25TKuMokCsawP9\"> click here to apply now \u003C\u002Fa>and upload your supporting documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Application opens May 1st and closes on the 22nd of May 2026 to allow people to get their results.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The submissions shall be screened by an independent consultant.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Announcement of Awardees shall be made on or around August 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fopeketefoundation.org\u002Fapply\">https:\u002F\u002Fopeketefoundation.org\u002Fapply\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-23 11:26:51",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffbm-scholarship-2026-florence-bamidele-makanjuola-scholarship-for-nigerian-undergraduates\u002F69e9f3eb99a680.05502416_screenshot 2026-04-23 110400.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffbm-scholarship-2026-florence-bamidele-makanjuola-scholarship-for-nigerian-undergraduates\u002F69e9f3eb99a680.05502416_screenshot%202026-04-23%20110400.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"dat